  "mathematicalScope": "Native coefficient chart comparison at shifts k and q*k. The equivalence of types is induced by the same numerator and denominator values. The ambient localization respects addition and the actual chart ring scalar action. The native weighted restriction square is checked on the corresponding f to f*g charts. No bundled LinearEquiv or global coefficient sheaf is included. Original 4.1, 4.2 and the main theorem remain open."
